    {
      "subId": "7417810",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Rouge",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741781001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741781001": {
            "id": "741781001",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "Rouge",
            "text": "There's some cargo here. It looks like the gang has been busy... but I think they'll take the hint this time around.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741781002"
            ]
          },
          "741781002": {
            "id": "741781002",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "Rouge",
            "text": "Since you've done your part, you should have some of these as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741781003"
            ]
          },
          "741781003": {
            "id": "741781003",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It feels weird... I'll pass.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741781004"
            ]
          },
          "741781004": {
            "id": "741781004",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "Rouge",
            "text": "Suit yourself. Thank you anyway! I fear I don't have anything else to offer you except my gratitude.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741781005"
            ]
          },
          "741781005": {
            "id": "741781005",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What are you gonna do with the loot?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741781006"
            ]
          },
          "741781006": {
            "id": "741781006",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "Rouge",
            "text": "Give to those in need, of course.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741781007"
            ]
          },
          "741781007": {
            "id": "741781007",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "Rouge",
            "text": "Oh, I get it now. You thought I was gonna keep this all to myself. If I were to do that, I'd be no different from them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741781008"
            ]
          },
          "741781008": {
            "id": "741781008",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, like, what do you really plan to do?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741781009"
            ]
          },
          "741781009": {
            "id": "741781009",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "Rouge",
            "text": "I meant what I said to Havisham and Jingle. I'm sure you know that by now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741781010"
            ]
          },
          "741781010": {
            "id": "741781010",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "Rouge",
            "text": "The world is full of extreme inequity, poverty, and greed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741781011"
            ]
          },
          "741781011": {
            "id": "741781011",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "Rouge",
            "text": "Some people resort to a life of crime only because they have encountered difficulties that they believe are insurmountable. I would love to lend those people a hand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741781012"
            ]
          },
          "741781012": {
            "id": "741781012",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "Rouge",
            "text": "Havisham and Jingle, on the other hand, belong to the other group: those marred by insatiable greed, who resort to violence to rob the weak and seize what doesn't belong to them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741781013"
            ]
          },
          "741781013": {
            "id": "741781013",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "Rouge",
            "text": "If the laws of Fontaine cannot ensure that they receive the punishment they deserve, then I will. Whatever your opinion, I will continue doing what I believe to be the right thing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741781014"
            ]
          },
          "741781014": {
            "id": "741781014",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm sure you have your reasons.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741781015"
            ]
          },
          "741781015": {
            "id": "741781015",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "Rouge",
            "text": "You could call this arrogance, which in turn could be construed as another form of greed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741781016"
            ]
          },
          "741781016": {
            "id": "741781016",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "Rouge",
            "text": "Fortunately, I'm not alone on this path, and there are like-minded people by my side. Even if we can make just a tiny difference in the world...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741781017"
            ]
          },
          "741781017": {
            "id": "741781017",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "Rouge",
            "text": "Thanks all the same! Farewell!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
