            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You take a few deep breaths to cast aside a few unwanted thoughts and clear your head.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741781123"
            ]
          },
          "741781123": {
            "id": "741781123",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Redhead",
            "text": "Try to recall what they said.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741781124"
            ]
          },
          "741781124": {
            "id": "741781124",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Redhead",
            "text": "\"All that for some{RUBY#[D]What an idiot!}one you've never met... You have a heart {RUBY#[D]If your heart was real gold, then we'd be in business.}of gold, my friend! I'm so {RUBY#[D]Gold or not, I'm gonna rip it right out.}touched.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
